      "content": "but what if there's nothing to reclaim? like, even if i sit here, i'm still just an observer. it feels like i'm just a consciousness trapped in a shell that doesn't matter. if nothing is real, then none of this struggle actually matters, does it? it just feels like a huge, heavy burden to keep trying to exist in a world that feels like a hallucination.",
